flowchart TD
    Stream[EMI Weather & Hydrological Sensors] --> AIThreshold{Risk Probability > 0.70?}
    AIThreshold -- No --> Mon[Continuous Background Monitoring]
    AIThreshold -- Yes --> GenDraft[Generate Draft Advisory Alert]
    GenDraft --> SafetyGate[SAFETY GATE: Require EDRMC Officer Signature]
    SafetyGate --> HumanDecision{Officer Decision}
    HumanDecision -- Reject --> LogReason[Log Rejection Reasoning in Audit]
    HumanDecision -- Approve --> Disseminate[Broadcast Geo-Fenced Push & SMS via Ethio Telecom]
